  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow when compiling crafted regexps\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-110264.patch: reject overflowed range-repeat\n       and null-check IDs in huge regexps\n     - CVE-2026-110264\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow when compiling crafted regexps\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93577-CVE-2026-97229.patch: avoid overflow in\n       the quantifier expansion size check and reject a compiled program too\n       big for its offset type\n     - CVE-2026-93577\n     - CVE-2026-97229\n   * Fix build-time test failures:\n     - debian/patches/fix-timezone-tests-and-update-expired-certs.patch:\n       replace the expired test certificates and follow the installed\n       tzdata in the Asia/Singapore checks\n     - debian/patches/fix-eaddrinuse-race-in-port0-tests.patch: avoid\n       EADDRINUSE races in tests that listen on a random port\n     - debian/tests/excludes: skip the DTrace probe tests and two\n       permission tests, which fail when the test suite runs as root",
